# MealHQ stack (FE)

## Runtime

- `frontend/` — provider + consumer (TypeScript App Router) — `:3000`
- `admin-frontend/` — platform admin — `:3001`
- No Mongo; no `backend/` folder — API is sibling **mealhq-api**

## Sibling API

- Path: `Documents/Programs/MINE/mealhq-api`
- Open via `MINE/MealHQ.code-workspace` (API + Web)
- Product/API conflicts → mealhq-api docs win

## Production

- Web: `https://www.mealhq.ca`
- API target: **`https://api2.mealhq.ca`** (operator sets Vercel env)

